    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hegarty Properties are delighted to present No. 16 Cois Cille, a beautifully maintained 3-bedroom semi-detached residence occupying a superb corner position within this well-established residential development in the heart of Conna.\r\nSet on an exceptionally generous site, this attractive home enjoys a large private rear garden, excellent privacy and an enviable sense of space rarely found in similar properties. Built in 2006 and extending to approximately 95.74 sq. m. (1,031 sq. ft.).\r\nLocated in the picturesque village of Conna, the property benefits from a strong sense of community while enjoying excellent connectivity to the surrounding towns and employment centres. Residents can avail of a range of local amenities including shops, schools, sporting facilities and community services, while Fermoy, Midleton and Cork City are all within convenient commuting distance. Positioned on the Cork–Waterford border, Conna offers the perfect balance of countryside living and accessibility."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor:\r\nEntrance Hall:\tA welcoming and bright entrance.\r\n\r\nGuest W.C.:\t\tComprising W.C. and wash hand basin.\r\n\r\nSitting Room:\tA generously proportioned family living room featuring a large front-facing window that fills the space with natural light. Finished with carpet flooring and a feature fireplace with open fire.\r\nKitchen/\r\nDining Area:\tFully fitted kitchen with integrated induction hob and oven. A bright dining area with double doors opening onto the rear garden. \r\nFirst Floor:\r\nMain Bedroom:\tA spacious front-aspect double bedroom with carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nEnsuite:\tComprising electric shower, W.C. and wash hand basin. Finished with tiled shower surround.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\tSpacious rear-aspect double with carpet flooring.\r\n\t\r\nBedroom 3:\tRear aspect with carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom:\tComprising bath with shower attachment, W.C. and wash hand basin. Finished with tiled shower area."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\t3-bedroom, 3-bathroom semi-detached family home \r\n•\tBER: B3 | BER No: 102345824 \r\n•\tBuilt in 2006\r\n•\tZoned oil-fired central heating\r\n•\tDouble-glazed windows & doors\r\n•\tAttic with STIRA fitted\r\n•\tLarge private rear garden\r\n•\tGenerous corner site\r\n•\tOff-street parking for two cars\r\n•\tSituated in a vibrant riverside village community\r\n•\tConveniently located within easy reach of Fermoy, Midleton and Cork City"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B3"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
