      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Viewing: \r\nPlease ring to make an appointment. Our office is open Monday to Friday."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Location",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Conna is a historic and thriving village set on the banks of the River Bride. Renowned for its strong community spirit, the village offers a range of local amenities including shops, schools, sporting facilities and community services. The area is also home to scenic riverside walks, historic landmarks and an active GAA club.\r\n\r\nFamilies are well catered for with local primary schools and school transport services to secondary schools in Fermoy and Midleton. Local Link connectivity to Fermoy.\r\nThe property is conveniently located approximately:\r\n•\t15 minutes from Fermoy\r\n•\t25 minutes from Midleton\r\n•\t40 minutes from Cork City"
      }
